cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite this software when using the formalization, including the Git commit you
  used. Cite the SoSyM paper separately for the language semantics.
type: software
title: 'Clafer Semantics: formal semantics of Clafer in Lean 4'
authors:
  - family-names: Bąk
    given-names: Kacper
repository-code: 'https://github.com/kbak/clafer-semantics'
url: 'https://github.com/kbak/clafer-semantics'
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A research formalization of Clafer modeling semantics with reusable DP-graph
  and formal class-diagram libraries, structural compilation, selected constraint
  correspondence results, and a verified finite structural candidate checker.
keywords:
  - Clafer
  - Lean 4
  - formal semantics
  - formal verification
